Fonts

The web interface (victorique/gui/static/ in the package) includes three fonts,
each licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. The license texts
are in the same folder.

- Michroma: Copyright 2011 The Michroma Project Authors
  (https://github.com/googlefonts/Michroma-font). License: OFL-michroma.txt.
- Barlow Semi Condensed: Copyright 2017 The Barlow Project Authors
  (https://github.com/jpt/barlow). License: OFL-barlowsemicondensed.txt.
- JetBrains Mono: Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
  (https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono). License: OFL-jetbrainsmono.txt.

The font files are the latin and latin-ext subsets, and for JetBrains Mono also
the greek subset and a math-symbol subset, as served by Google Fonts.
